            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.9.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 9:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth odwoko ni, “Alamiyo dwoŋ paran luwo ruwaŋin, aka ruwaŋin abino tuco nyingan maleŋ. An abedo Rwoth, aka anyutho wor gi kisa ri jono m'ayero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "T'ikinyal neno waŋan, rupiri ongoye ŋata nenan to doŋ makwo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neni, nitie kabedo kabutan m'inyalo cung'iye wi got. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka ka dwoŋ paran luwo, abino kethin kam'oyawere i got t'aumin gi cingan cuka aluwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
